 {
  "id": "en_clip00",
  "file": "out/fixtures/en_clip00.wav",
  "text": "MISTER QUILTER IS THE APOSTLE OF THE MIDDLE CLASSES AND WE ARE GLAD TO WELCOME HIS GOSPEL",
  "duration_s": 5.855,
  "n_samples": 93680,
  "n_samples_mod_960": 560,
  "lang": "en",
  "source_id": "1272-128104-0000",
  "source": "LibriSpeech dev-clean 1272-128104-0000 via hf-internal-testing/librispeech_asr_dummy (granite_speech_work/fixtures/clip00.flac)",
  "license": "CC BY 4.0"
 },
 {
  "id": "en_clip01",
  "file": "out/fixtures/en_clip01.wav",
  "text": "NOR IS MISTER QUILTER'S MANNER LESS INTERESTING THAN HIS MATTER",
  "duration_s": 4.815,
  "n_samples": 77040,
  "n_samples_mod_960": 240,
  "lang": "en",
  "source_id": "1272-128104-0001",
  "source": "LibriSpeech dev-clean 1272-128104-0001 via hf-internal-testing/librispeech_asr_dummy (granite_speech_work/fixtures/clip01.flac)",
  "license": "CC BY 4.0"
 },
 {
  "id": "en_clip02",
  "file": "out/fixtures/en_clip02.wav",
  "text": "HE TELLS US THAT AT THIS FESTIVE SEASON OF THE YEAR WITH CHRISTMAS AND ROAST BEEF LOOMING BEFORE US SIMILES DRAWN FROM EATING AND ITS RESULTS OCCUR MOST READILY TO THE MIND",
  "duration_s": 12.485,
  "n_samples": 199760,
  "n_samples_mod_960": 80,
  "lang": "en",
  "source_id": "1272-128104-0002",
  "source": "LibriSpeech dev-clean 1272-128104-0002 via hf-internal-testing/librispeech_asr_dummy (granite_speech_work/fixtures/clip02.flac)",
  "license": "CC BY 4.0"
 },
 {
  "id": "en_clip03",
  "file": "out/fixtures/en_clip03.wav",
  "text": "HE HAS GRAVE DOUBTS WHETHER SIR FREDERICK LEIGHTON'S WORK IS REALLY GREEK AFTER ALL AND CAN DISCOVER IN IT BUT LITTLE OF ROCKY ITHACA",
  "duration_s": 9.9,
  "n_samples": 158400,
  "n_samples_mod_960": 0,
  "lang": "en",
  "source_id": "1272-128104-0003",
  "source": "LibriSpeech dev-clean 1272-128104-0003 via hf-internal-testing/librispeech_asr_dummy (granite_speech_work/fixtures/clip03.flac)",
  "license": "CC BY 4.0"
 },
 {
  "id": "en_clip04",
  "file": "out/fixtures/en_clip04.wav",
  "text": "LINNELL'S PICTURES ARE A SORT OF UP GUARDS AND AT EM PAINTINGS AND MASON'S EXQUISITE IDYLLS ARE AS NATIONAL AS A JINGO POEM MISTER BIRKET FOSTER'S LANDSCAPES SMILE AT ONE MUCH IN THE SAME WAY THAT MISTER CARKER USED TO FLASH HIS TEETH AND MISTER JOHN COLLIER GIVES HIS SITTER A CHEERFUL SLAP ON THE BACK BEFORE HE SAYS LIKE A SHAMPOOER IN A TURKISH BATH NEXT MAN",
  "duration_s": 29.4,
  "n_samples": 470400,
  "n_samples_mod_960": 0,
  "lang": "en",
  "source_id": "1272-128104-0004",
  "source": "LibriSpeech dev-clean 1272-128104-0004 via hf-internal-testing/librispeech_asr_dummy (granite_speech_work/fixtures/clip04.flac)",
  "license": "CC BY 4.0"
 },
 {
  "id": "en_clip05",
  "file": "out/fixtures/en_clip05.wav",
  "text": "IT IS OBVIOUSLY UNNECESSARY FOR US TO POINT OUT HOW LUMINOUS THESE CRITICISMS ARE HOW DELICATE IN EXPRESSION",
  "duration_s": 9.01,
  "n_samples": 144160,
  "n_samples_mod_960": 160,
  "lang": "en",
  "source_id": "1272-128104-0005",
  "source": "LibriSpeech dev-clean 1272-128104-0005 via hf-internal-testing/librispeech_asr_dummy (granite_speech_work/fixtures/clip05.flac)",
  "license": "CC BY 4.0"
 },
 {
  "id": "en_clip06",
  "file": "out/fixtures/en_clip06.wav",
  "text": "ON THE GENERAL PRINCIPLES OF ART MISTER QUILTER WRITES WITH EQUAL LUCIDITY",
  "duration_s": 5.64,
  "n_samples": 90240,
  "n_samples_mod_960": 0,
  "lang": "en",
  "source_id": "1272-128104-0006",
  "source": "LibriSpeech dev-clean 1272-128104-0006 via hf-internal-testing/librispeech_asr_dummy (granite_speech_work/fixtures/clip06.flac)",
  "license": "CC BY 4.0"
 },
 {
  "id": "en_clip07",
  "file": "out/fixtures/en_clip07.wav",
  "text": "PAINTING HE TELLS US IS OF A DIFFERENT QUALITY TO MATHEMATICS AND FINISH IN ART IS ADDING MORE FACT",
  "duration_s": 9.24,
  "n_samples": 147840,
  "n_samples_mod_960": 0,
  "lang": "en",
  "source_id": "1272-128104-0007",
  "source": "LibriSpeech dev-clean 1272-128104-0007 via hf-internal-testing/librispeech_asr_dummy (granite_speech_work/fixtures/clip07.flac)",
  "license": "CC BY 4.0"
 },
 {
  "id": "en_clip08",
  "file": "out/fixtures/en_clip08.wav",
  "text": "AS FOR ETCHINGS THEY ARE OF TWO KINDS BRITISH AND FOREIGN",
  "duration_s": 5.12,
  "n_samples": 81920,
  "n_samples_mod_960": 320,
  "lang": "en",
  "source_id": "1272-128104-0008",
  "source": "LibriSpeech dev-clean 1272-128104-0008 via hf-internal-testing/librispeech_asr_dummy (granite_speech_work/fixtures/clip08.flac)",
  "license": "CC BY 4.0"
 },
 {
  "id": "en_clip09",
  "file": "out/fixtures/en_clip09.wav",
  "text": "HE LAMENTS MOST BITTERLY THE DIVORCE THAT HAS BEEN MADE BETWEEN DECORATIVE ART AND WHAT WE USUALLY CALL PICTURES MAKES THE CUSTOMARY APPEAL TO THE LAST JUDGMENT AND REMINDS US THAT IN THE GREAT DAYS OF ART MICHAEL ANGELO WAS THE FURNISHING UPHOLSTERER",
  "duration_s": 18.29,
  "n_samples": 292640,
  "n_samples_mod_960": 800,
  "lang": "en",
  "source_id": "1272-128104-0009",
  "source": "LibriSpeech dev-clean 1272-128104-0009 via hf-internal-testing/librispeech_asr_dummy (granite_speech_work/fixtures/clip09.flac)",
  "license": "CC BY 4.0"
 },
 {
  "id": "en_clip10",
  "file": "out/fixtures/en_clip10.wav",
  "text": "NEAR THE FIRE AND THE ORNAMENTS FRED BROUGHT HOME FROM INDIA ON THE MANTEL BOARD",
  "duration_s": 5.6,
  "n_samples": 89600,
  "n_samples_mod_960": 320,
  "lang": "en",
  "source_id": "1272-128104-0010",
  "source": "LibriSpeech dev-clean 1272-128104-0010 via hf-internal-testing/librispeech_asr_dummy (granite_speech_work/fixtures/clip10.flac)",
  "license": "CC BY 4.0"
 },
 {
  "id": "en_clip11",
  "file": "out/fixtures/en_clip11.wav",
  "text": "IN FACT HE IS QUITE SEVERE ON MISTER RUSKIN FOR NOT RECOGNISING THAT A PICTURE SHOULD DENOTE THE FRAILTY OF MAN AND REMARKS WITH PLEASING COURTESY AND FELICITOUS GRACE THAT MANY PHASES OF FEELING",
  "duration_s": 15.115,
  "n_samples": 241840,
  "n_samples_mod_960": 880,
  "lang": "en",
  "source_id": "1272-128104-0011",
  "source": "LibriSpeech dev-clean 1272-128104-0011 via hf-internal-testing/librispeech_asr_dummy (granite_speech_work/fixtures/clip11.flac)",
  "license": "CC BY 4.0"
 },
 {
  "id": "en_clip12",
  "file": "out/fixtures/en_clip12.wav",
  "text": "ONLY UNFORTUNATELY HIS OWN WORK NEVER DOES GET GOOD",
  "duration_s": 5.38,
  "n_samples": 86080,
  "n_samples_mod_960": 640,
  "lang": "en",
  "source_id": "1272-128104-0012",
  "source": "LibriSpeech dev-clean 1272-128104-0012 via hf-internal-testing/librispeech_asr_dummy (granite_speech_work/fixtures/clip12.flac)",
  "license": "CC BY 4.0"
 },
 {
  "id": "en_clip13",
  "file": "out/fixtures/en_clip13.wav",
  "text": "MISTER QUILTER HAS MISSED HIS CHANCE FOR HE HAS FAILED EVEN TO MAKE HIMSELF THE TUPPER OF PAINTING",
  "duration_s": 7.1,
  "n_samples": 113600,
  "n_samples_mod_960": 320,
  "lang": "en",
  "source_id": "1272-128104-0013",
  "source": "LibriSpeech dev-clean 1272-128104-0013 via hf-internal-testing/librispeech_asr_dummy (granite_speech_work/fixtures/clip13.flac)",
  "license": "CC BY 4.0"
 },
 {
  "id": "en_clip14",
  "file": "out/fixtures/en_clip14.wav",
  "text": "BY HARRY QUILTER M A",
  "duration_s": 2.245,
  "n_samples": 35920,
  "n_samples_mod_960": 400,
  "lang": "en",
  "source_id": "1272-128104-0014",
  "source": "LibriSpeech dev-clean 1272-128104-0014 via hf-internal-testing/librispeech_asr_dummy (granite_speech_work/fixtures/clip14.flac)",
  "license": "CC BY 4.0"
 },
 {
  "id": "en_clip15",
  "file": "out/fixtures/en_clip15.wav",
  "text": "BECAUSE YOU WERE SLEEPING INSTEAD OF CONQUERING THE LOVELY ROSE PRINCESS HAS BECOME A FIDDLE WITHOUT A BOW WHILE POOR SHAGGY SITS THERE A COOING DOVE",
  "duration_s": 10.885,
  "n_samples": 174160,
  "n_samples_mod_960": 400,
  "lang": "en",
  "source_id": "1272-135031-0000",
  "source": "LibriSpeech dev-clean 1272-135031-0000 via hf-internal-testing/librispeech_asr_dummy (granite_speech_work/fixtures/clip15.flac)",
  "license": "CC BY 4.0"
 },
 {
  "id": "en_clip16",
  "file": "out/fixtures/en_clip16.wav",
  "text": "HE HAS GONE AND GONE FOR GOOD ANSWERED POLYCHROME WHO HAD MANAGED TO SQUEEZE INTO THE ROOM BESIDE THE DRAGON AND HAD WITNESSED THE OCCURRENCES WITH MUCH INTEREST",
  "duration_s": 11.13,
  "n_samples": 178080,
  "n_samples_mod_960": 480,
  "lang": "en",
  "source_id": "1272-135031-0001",
  "source": "LibriSpeech dev-clean 1272-135031-0001 via hf-internal-testing/librispeech_asr_dummy (granite_speech_work/fixtures/clip16.flac)",
  "license": "CC BY 4.0"
 },
 {
  "id": "en_clip17",
  "file": "out/fixtures/en_clip17.wav",
  "text": "I HAVE REMAINED A PRISONER ONLY BECAUSE I WISHED TO BE ONE AND WITH THIS HE STEPPED FORWARD AND BURST THE STOUT CHAINS AS EASILY AS IF THEY HAD BEEN THREADS",
  "duration_s": 11.475,
  "n_samples": 183600,
  "n_samples_mod_960": 240,
  "lang": "en",
  "source_id": "1272-135031-0002",
  "source": "LibriSpeech dev-clean 1272-135031-0002 via hf-internal-testing/librispeech_asr_dummy (granite_speech_work/fixtures/clip17.flac)",
  "license": "CC BY 4.0"
 },
 {
  "id": "en_clip18",
  "file": "out/fixtures/en_clip18.wav",
  "text": "THE LITTLE GIRL HAD BEEN ASLEEP BUT SHE HEARD THE RAPS AND OPENED THE DOOR",
  "duration_s": 4.755,
  "n_samples": 76080,
  "n_samples_mod_960": 240,
  "lang": "en",
  "source_id": "1272-135031-0003",
  "source": "LibriSpeech dev-clean 1272-135031-0003 via hf-internal-testing/librispeech_asr_dummy (granite_speech_work/fixtures/clip18.flac)",
  "license": "CC BY 4.0"
 },
 {
